      "writtenOn": "2025-04-30T21:51:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This member should be named `mr_low_res_mode_info_owned`.\n\n`mem_loc` is the name of a local variable in vpx/src/vpx_encoder.c. Without knowing that, the name `mem_loc_owned` doesn\u0027t make sense here.",
